breaking_changes.Adaptation_method:
Remove all usage of the `onFID()` function and related types (`FIDMetric`, `FIDThresholds`, etc.). Replace with the INP (Interaction to Next Paint) metric which is the recommended replacement for FID:

```javascript
// Before
import {onFID} from 'web-vitals';

onFID((metric) => {
  console.log('FID:', metric.value);
});

// After
import {onINP} from 'web-vitals';

onINP((metric) => {
  console.log('INP:', metric.value);
});
```
